  "description": "Small shared helpers for Muslim.* applications: the ICurrentUser contract (auto-registered through Muslim.Inject), a Base64 data URI decoder (Base64Data), and an EF Core comma-separated string list converter with a change-tracking comparer (StringListConverter, StringListComparer, HasStringListConversion).",
