  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "StringListConverter now reads an empty column back as an empty list; new StringListComparer and HasStringListConversion make EF Core save in-place list changes. Base64Data keeps the decoding error as InnerException and parses without splitting the whole string. Ships version-matched agent guidance and generates .agents/skills/muslim-helpers during normal consuming builds; preserves user files and supports MuslimHelpersGenerateSkill=false. See CHANGELOG.md and README.md.",
